        "description": "Sending POST /booking with no body returns 500 Internal Server Error. It should return 400 Bad Request.\n\n**Bug:** POST /booking with empty body returns 500 Internal Server Error.  \n**Expected:** 400 Bad Request with a validation message.  \n**Steps:** Send POST /booking with Content-Type: application/json and an empty body  \n**Severity:** Medium (server error on invalid input)."
